// Title: Remote Access Tool - NetSupport Execution From Unusual Location
// ID: 37e8d358-6408-4853-82f4-98333fca7014
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-09-19
// Tags: attack.stealth
// Description: Detects execution of client32.exe (NetSupport RAT) from an unusual location (outside of 'C:\Program Files')
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((where(Image IENDSWITH "\\client32.exe")) OR (where(Product ICONTAINS "NetSupport Remote Control")) OR (where(OriginalFileName ICONTAINS "client32.exe")) OR (where(Hashes ICONTAINS "IMPHASH=a9d50692e95b79723f3e76fcf70d023e"))) AND NOT (((where(Image ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Program Files\\") OR where(Image ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\")))))
